          "type": "beetle-psx",
          "title": "Bomberman World",
          "description": "This is Bomberman's first appearance on the PlayStation in North America.  This version maintains the style of play of the 2D Bomberman games, but has a pseudo-3D look to it.  Bomberman World features the one player story mode as found in all Bomberman games, but it most importantly has a five player battle mode.  The multiplayer game has twelve different maps, along with three different modes of play.",
