          "type": "beetle-psx",
          "title": "Chocobo Racing",
          "description": "The Chocobo has appeared in every Final Fantasy game as a large yellow bird that you can ride to other destinations or use during fights. With Chocobo Racing, you can race a Chocobo along with a range of different characters both from the Final Fantasy world and created just for the game through many different fantasy worlds at high speed, using a selection of weapons to aid you. 1 and 2 player racing available.",
