          "type": "beetle-psx",
          "title": "Croc - Legend of the Gobbos",
          "description": "All is not well in Croc's world.  His friends, the Gobbos, have been captured by the evil Baron Dante.  It is your mission in this 3D platformer to search through 42 different levels to save all of your friends before it's too late.",
          "thumbnail": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/webrcade-assets/webrcade-assets-psx-images/master/Named_Titles/resized/Croc%20-%20Legend%20of%20the%20Gobbos%20(Europe).png",
