          "type": "beetle-psx",
          "title": "Tales of Destiny II Disco 1",
          "description": "Reid and Farrah are two friends who live together in a little town. One day, a mysterious young girl falls down from the sky and is found by the two friends. After a while, they discover that her name is Meredy and that she has come to prevent the collision of her world Celestia with Inferia, the planet on which Reid and Farrah live. The three decide to set out on a quest to collect elemental spiritual beings that alone can stop the terrible disaster.\n\nTales of Destiny II (Tales of Eternia in Japan) is an action RPG with a somewhat unusual battle system. Although there is a party, the battles occur in real time. The player physically controls only Reid, making him perform various attacks. The other party members are controlled by the game's AI, but it is possible to choose an overall strategy for their actions: for example, one should concentrate on healing while the other attacks physically, etc.",
