          "type": "retro-pce-fast",
          "title": "Dragon Knight III",
          "description": "This version of Dragon Knight III is based on the earlier computer release, known in the West as Knights of Xentar. While retaining the story, the graphical style, and the basic location layout of the computer version, this release has substantial gameplay differences.",
          "thumbnail": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
